===== LAUNCH KIDDOS =====
Use the controller or mapped keyboard controls:
1. Move left and right through the carousel.
2. Press A / Confirm on a game.
3. Confirm Selected Game appears with Play focused.
4. Press B / Back and confirm the same game remains selected.
5. Repeat with another game.
6. Exit the application normally.

